What each part of the project is made of: which files, which tests, which documents, and what starts it.

workbench/tools_test.py (Maintainers) checks it: every pattern names a file there is, every test is there, and every
driver of drivers/, every tool of tools/ and every file of arch/arm64/boot/ belongs to a part. Parts are in
alphabetical order.

	F:	Files: a path, or a pattern of them (* within a directory, a directory ending in / for all under it)
	T:	Tests: a path (run by make check unless it says otherwise)
	D:	Documents that explain it
	K:	The feature of a board, and the boot argument, that start it

